@startuml assembly
' LocalAiRobot — high-level power, TOP-TO-BOTTOM (one 3S LiPo -> ESC drive + UBEC -> UPS -> Pi).
' This source lives next to its render. Regenerate in place (writes assembly.png here):
'   plantuml -tpng docs/images/assembly.puml
' No Graphviz needed: !pragma layout smetana. Vertical + larger fonts; Pi peripherals collapsed into one box.
!pragma layout smetana
top to bottom direction
hide stereotype
title LocalAiRobot — one 3S LiPo powers all (ESC -> drive + UBEC -> UPS -> Pi); bench-test on the 27W PSU first

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam TitleFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 15
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 12
  FontSize 18
  BorderThickness 1.5
  BackgroundColor<<io>> #DAE8FC
  BorderColor<<io>> #6C8EBF
  BackgroundColor<<model>> #FFF2CC
  BorderColor<<model>> #D6B656
  BackgroundColor<<data>> #D5E8D4
  BorderColor<<data>> #82B366
  BackgroundColor<<motor>> #F8CECC
  BorderColor<<motor>> #B85450
  BackgroundColor<<store>> #F5F5F5
  BorderColor<<store>> #666666
}

rectangle "3S 11.1V LiPo\n(single source)" as lipo <<motor>>
rectangle "ESC\n(battery input + BEC for servo)" as esc <<motor>>
rectangle "drive motor" as motor <<motor>>
rectangle "ZTW UBEC\n3S -> 5-6V / 6A step-down" as ubec <<motor>>
rectangle "UPS HAT\n2x 18650 backup (or 27W PSU bench)" as ups <<io>>
rectangle "Raspberry Pi 5\n+ Active Cooler (mandatory)" as pi <<io>>
rectangle "PCA9685\nI2C PWM; 3.3V logic from Pi,\nV+ rail from the ESC BEC" as pca <<model>>
rectangle "Pi-powered peripherals\nCamera: Arducam IMX519 (autofocus, CSI)\nFace screen (USB-C / ttyACM0)\nHC-SR04P x3 (3.3V; front/left/right)" as periph <<data>>
rectangle "common GND bus" as gnd <<store>>

lipo --> esc  : 11.1V (high current)
lipo --> ubec : 11.1V (tap)
esc  --> motor : motor drive
ubec --> ups  : 5-6V -> UPS input
ups  --> pi   : 5V
pi   --> pca  : 3.3V logic + I2C
pi   --> periph : CSI · USB-C · 3.3V+GPIO

esc  ..> gnd : GND
pi   ..> gnd : GND
pca  ..> gnd : GND
ubec ..> gnd : GND

note bottom of gnd
  **One 3S LiPo powers everything:** ESC branch (drive + servo BEC) + **UBEC (5-6V) -> UPS -> Pi**.
  The UPS 18650s stay as a **backup buffer**. Tie **ALL grounds** together: Pi <-> PCA9685 <-> ESC <-> UBEC,
  or the PWM won't register. Bench-test on the **27W PSU first** (UBEC/UPS later). **Active Cooler is mandatory.**
  Camera (CSI), face panel (USB-C) and the 3 HC-SR04P are all Pi-side.
end note
@enduml
